### Dataset Terms and Attribution

The MIT License applies strictly to the source code, notebooks, scripts, documentation, and configuration files contained in this repository.

The dataset used in this project originates from the New York City Taxi and Limousine Commission (TLC) Trip Record Data, released under the City of New York Open Data Terms of Use and distributed via Kaggle ("NYC Taxi Trip Duration"). The dataset is subject to its original terms and licensing from NYC TLC and is not licensed under the MIT License. Users must obtain or access the data directly from the official TLC Open Data portal or Kaggle repository.
